'''One Horn''' (一角くん, ''Ikkaku-kun'', '''One Horn-kun''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

