'''ItF''': [[Denmark (Into the Future)|Chapter 1 - Denmark]]<br>
'''CotC''': [[Saturn (Cats of the Cosmos)|Chapter 1 - Saturn]]<br>
'''SoL''': [[Playing Pirates|Sub-chapter 4 - Playing Pirates]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Banishin' Tigers|Sub-chapter 5 - Banishin' Tigers]]
|money drop = 2,500¢ - 9,875¢
}}

==Enemy==
An odd enemy that can serve as either free money or the main threat depending on the stage. One Horn sports high damage output and a gigantic health pool, similarly to [[Bore]]. However, his movement speed and range are ''very'' lacking.

==Strategy==
To defeat him early on, use [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]] with [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]] like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]. If you are a new player, don't let One Horn get too close to the [[Cat Base]], since he'll easily be able to destroy it.

This enemy becomes less and less threatening as you progress through the game due to the wide abundance of powerful [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]]. However, keep in mind that his DPS stays consistently high, allowing him to slowly but surely plow through your defenses if you don't have any unit that can hold him back like [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Onmyoji Cat]] or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]].

