==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = One Horn
|Metal One Horn
|A [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of One Horn. Has extreme DPS and takes only one damage from non-[[Critical Hit|Critical]] attacks, but has very low health, is knocked back twice and is only slightly faster.
|Samurai Doggy
|A Red-Dark hybrid variant consisting of [[Doge Dark]] riding a One Horn. First appears in [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]]. They're much faster with greater DPS, attack rate, and 100% chance to knockback cats, as well as two knockbacks instead of one.
|Cyberhorn
|An [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of One Horn, with much more health and damage.
|Oldhorn
|A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of One Horn, with a ridiculous amount of health, DPS, and the ability to [[Curse]] Cat Units but still retains pitiful range and movement speed.
}}

